</pre></td><td class="rouge-code"><pre>tools/
├── newpost.sh              <span class="c"># post creation script</span>
└── scaffolds/              <span class="c"># body templates (like hexo scaffolds)</span>
    ├── post.md             <span class="c"># Chinese template</span>
    └── post.en.md          <span class="c"># English template</span>
