<h2 id="body-templates">Body templates</h2>

<p><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">tools/scaffolds/post.md</code> is the standard opening of every post on this site, and <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">tools/scaffolds/post.en.md</code> is its English counterpart. To change the boilerplate, just edit the template — all future posts pick it up automatically, exactly like editing <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">scaffolds/post.md</code> in Hexo.</p>

